# ROOTfiles is bulk-ignored above, but the MC input symlink lives under it
# and needs to be tracked -- it's how a checkout points sim replays at
# wherever digitized MC actually lives (see libLADdig/README.md).
!ROOTfiles/LAD
!ROOTfiles/LAD/SIM
!ROOTfiles/LAD/SIM/INPUT
